        This is a simplified example for the Spanish Energy Performance Certificate.
        The root element declares the default namespace for all child elements.
    -->
    <DatosDelCertificador>
        <NombreyApellidos>Juan Pérez García</NombreyApellidos>
        <NIF>12345678Z</NIF>
